3. Spreadsheet reader and writer
--------------------------------

The spreadsheet reader and writer (sicopr_assist/xlsx_io.py) start from
gui/config_io.py in SiCoPR (https://github.com/tbermen/SiCoPR), at commit
55c3f717bf8e17daffe65ecf20215a4fbcdb0833 (SiCoPR 1.1.1), by the same author and
under the same licence.

